---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="ERP Grupo Pineda — Infraestructura, Concreto MATEPCO & Cantera ROCAFER | Archity"
  description="Caso de éxito y arquitectura del ERP a medida para Grupo Pineda: control de plantas de concreto MATEPCO, planta chancadora ROCAFER (780 TM/día), SERVIPIPA y PRINCOR en el nororiente peruano."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="ca-grid">
    <!-- Hero del Caso / ERP Grupo Pineda con su logo oficial y logos de unidades -->
    <section class="border-b border-[var(--ca-ink)]/15 py-16 sm:py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

        <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
        <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-neutral-500 mb-8" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors">Inicio</a>
          <span>/</span>
          <a href="/#productos" class="hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors">Productos</a>
          <span>/</span>
          <span class="text-neutral-900">ERP Grupo Pineda</span>
        </nav>

        <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
          <div>
            <!-- Logo oficial de Grupo Pineda -->
            <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 shadow-2xs">
              <img src="/logos/grupo-pineda-logo.svg" alt="Grupo Pineda Logo Oficial" class="h-9 w-auto object-contain" />
              <span class="h-4 w-px bg-neutral-200"></span>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-accent">
                <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-accent animate-pulse" />
                ERP Consorcio en Vivo
              </span>
            </div>

            <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 sm:text-5xl">
              ERP Grupo Pineda
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg font-medium text-accent mt-1">
              Sistema de Gestión Integral para Infraestructura, Minería &amp; Concreto
            </p>

            <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 sm:text-lg">
              Sistema empresarial multi-compañía desarrollado por <strong>Archity</strong> para el consorcio <strong>Grupo Pineda</strong> (<a href="https://grupopineda.pe/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent underline font-semibold">grupopineda.pe</a>), líder en infraestructura vial, plantas automatizadas de concreto premezclado (<strong>MATEPCO</strong>), minería no metálica (<strong>ROCAFER</strong> — 780 TM/día), maquinaria pesada (<strong>SERVIPIPA</strong>) y distribución mayorista (<strong>PRINCOR</strong>) en San Martín y Amazonas.
            </p>

            <!-- Logos de Unidades de Negocio -->
            <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 shadow-2xs">
                <img src="/logos/matepco-logo.svg" alt="MATEPCO" class="h-6 w-auto object-contain" />
                <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-neutral-600">Concreto Premezclado</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 shadow-2xs">
                <img src="/logos/rocafer-logo.svg" alt="ROCAFER" class="h-6 w-auto object-contain" />
                <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-neutral-600">Cantera 780 TM/Día</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Acciones -->
            <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
              <a
                href="https://grupopineda.pe/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-xs transition-all hover:bg-accent-dark hover:shadow-md hover:shadow-accent/20"
              >
                Visitar grupopineda.pe
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="h-4 w-4">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 6H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 8.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0018 18.75V10.5m-10.5 6L21 3m0 0h-5.25M21 3v5.25" />
                </svg>
              </a>

              <a
                href="#modulos"
                class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-neutral-300 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-700 transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-50"
              >
                Explorar Arquitectura del ERP
              </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Stats reales del consorcio -->
            <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-neutral-200/80 pt-6 text-left">
              <div>
                <span class="block font-display text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900">780 TM</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Capacidad/Día ROCAFER</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span class="block font-display text-2xl font-bold text-accent">3 Sedes</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Plantas MATEPCO</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span class="block font-display text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900">4 Empresas</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Integración Vertical</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Mockup visual representativo de panel industrial ERP -->
          <div class="relative">
            <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200/90 bg-white shadow-xl shadow-neutral-900/5">
              <!-- Barra superior simulada -->
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-900 px-4 py-3 text-white">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                  <img src="/logos/grupo-pineda-mark.svg" alt="GP" class="h-5 w-5 rounded" />
                  <span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-wider font-semibold">ERP GRUPO PINEDA · CONTROL INDUSTRIAL</span>
                </div>
                <span class="text-[11px] text-emerald-400 font-mono">PROD · grupopineda.pe</span>
              </div>

              <!-- Interfaz simulada del ERP -->
              <div class="p-6 space-y-4 bg-neutral-50/50">
                <!-- Status bar de plantas -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
                  <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-3 shadow-xs">
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-neutral-400 uppercase font-semibold">Planta Tarapoto</span>
                    <strong class="block text-sm font-bold text-neutral-900 mt-0.5">MATEPCO #1</strong>
                    <span class="inline-block mt-1 text-[10px] text-accent font-bold bg-accent-soft px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-accent/20">Operando</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-3 shadow-xs">
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-neutral-400 uppercase font-semibold">Planta Moyobamba</span>
                    <strong class="block text-sm font-bold text-neutral-900 mt-0.5">MATEPCO #2</strong>
                    <span class="inline-block mt-1 text-[10px] text-accent font-bold bg-accent-soft px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-accent/20">Operando</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-3 shadow-xs">
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-neutral-400 uppercase font-semibold">Chancadora Picota</span>
                    <strong class="block text-sm font-bold text-neutral-900 mt-0.5">ROCAFER</strong>
                    <span class="inline-block mt-1 text-[10px] text-neutral-900 font-bold bg-neutral-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-neutral-200">780 TM/D</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Monitor de pesaje y balanza -->
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-xs">
                  <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-2">
                    <span class="font-bold text-neutral-800">Telemetría de Balanza &amp; Despachos</span>
                    <span class="font-mono text-neutral-400 text-[11px]">Cantera Picota &amp; Mixers</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-100">
                      <div>
                        <strong class="text-neutral-900 font-semibold">Volquete V-104 (Piedra Chancada 3/4")</strong>
                        <span class="block text-[11px] text-neutral-500">ROCAFER Picota &rarr; Tramo Vial Moyobamba</span>
                      </div>
                      <span class="font-mono font-bold text-neutral-900">32.4 TM</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-100">
                      <div>
                        <strong class="text-neutral-900 font-semibold">Mixer M-08 (Concreto f'c 280 kg/cm²)</strong>
                        <span class="block text-[11px] text-neutral-500">Despacho Automatizado MATEPCO Tarapoto</span>
                      </div>
                      <span class="font-mono font-bold text-accent">8.0 m³</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Indicador de seguridad Android Device Owner -->
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-3 text-xs">
                  <span class="text-neutral-600 font-medium">Terminales Android en Planta (Device Owner Kiosk APK)</span>
                  <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold">Sincronizado</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Módulos del Sistema ERP -->
    <section id="modulos" class="py-20 bg-white">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

        <div class="max-w-2xl text-center mx-auto">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent">Alcance Operativo Multi-Empresa</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 sm:text-4xl">
            Las 4 Unidades Integradas en el ERP
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-neutral-600">
            Backend construido con Django REST Framework, PostgreSQL, Docker, Nginx y aplicación móvil corporativa Android con bloqueo Device Owner.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-16 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
          <!-- 01 Concreto Automatizado -->
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200/80 p-6 bg-neutral-50/50 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300">
            <div class="mb-4 h-10 flex items-center">
              <img src="/logos/matepco-logo.svg" alt="MATEPCO" class="h-8 w-auto object-contain" />
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono text-accent">01 · CONCRETO PREMEZCLADO</span>
            <h3 class="mt-1 font-display text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">Plantas MATEPCO</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">
              Control de plantas dosificadoras automatizadas en Tarapoto, Moyobamba y Chachapoyas. Monitoreo de diseños de mezcla (f'c 175 a 350 kg/cm²), control de slump, aditivos y despacho de camiones mixer.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 02 Minería y Agregados -->
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200/80 p-6 bg-neutral-50/50 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300">
            <div class="mb-4 h-10 flex items-center">
              <img src="/logos/rocafer-logo.svg" alt="ROCAFER" class="h-8 w-auto object-contain" />
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono text-neutral-900">02 · CANTERA &amp; AGREGADOS</span>
            <h3 class="mt-1 font-display text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">ROCAFER (780 TM/Día)</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">
              Gestión de extracción minera no metálica en cantera Picota, trituración primaria y secundaria de piedra caliza, granulometría certificada, tickets de balanza electrónica y stock de áridos.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 03 Flota y Maquinaria -->
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200/80 p-6 bg-neutral-50/50 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300">
            <div class="mb-4 h-10 flex items-center">
              <img src="/logos/grupo-pineda-mark.svg" alt="SERVIPIPA" class="h-8 w-8 object-contain rounded" />
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono text-accent">03 · MAQUINARIA PESADA</span>
            <h3 class="mt-1 font-display text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">SERVIPIPA &amp; Flota</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">
              Gestión de línea amarilla, excavadoras, cargadores frontales, cisternas y volquetes: partes diarios de horómetro, mantenimiento preventivo, control de galones de combustible y valorizaciones.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 04 Comercial B2B -->
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200/80 p-6 bg-neutral-50/50 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300">
            <div class="mb-4 h-10 flex items-center">
              <img src="/logos/grupo-pineda-mark.svg" alt="PRINCOR" class="h-8 w-8 object-contain rounded" />
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono text-neutral-900">04 · COMERCIAL &amp; ACERO</span>
            <h3 class="mt-1 font-display text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">Distribuidora PRINCOR</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">
              Abastecimiento mayorista de materiales de construcción, fierro corrugado y cemento. Cotizaciones B2B, órdenes de compra, kardex multi-almacén y facturación electrónica integrada.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Banner CTA final -->
    <section class="border-t border-neutral-200/70 bg-neutral-900 text-white py-16">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
          ¿Tu consorcio necesita un ERP industrial a la medida?
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-neutral-400 max-w-xl mx-auto text-sm sm:text-base">
          En Archity diseñamos y desplegamos plataformas empresariales conectadas a tus plantas, balanzas, almacenes y facturación SUNAT.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3">
          <a
            href="https://grupopineda.pe/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-accent-dark transition-colors shadow-xs"
          >
            Visitar grupopineda.pe ↗
          </a>
          <a
            href="/productos/billing-service"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-neutral-700 bg-neutral-800 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-neutral-700 transition-colors"
          >
            Ver Facturador SUNAT UBL 2.1 &rarr;
          </a>
          <a
            href="/#contacto"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-neutral-700 bg-neutral-800 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-neutral-700 transition-colors"
          >
            Cotizar ERP con Archity
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
